  <metadata>
    <name>Lakeland Way — Anticlockwise day 8 (2026-09-07)</name>
    <desc>Base 23.5km, +701m; with 2 detour(s): +5.5km, +762m ascent. Total 29.0km.</desc>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="54.568648" lon="-3.170826">
    <ele>451.0</ele>
    <name>Cat Bells 451m</name>
    <desc>A 451m ridge above Derwent Water, out of all proportion in popularity to its size — a short, rocky, thoroughly enjoyable up-and-down with a superb view over the lake. Detour: +12.9km, +365m ascent.</desc>
    <type>peaks</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.593277" lon="-3.032240">
    <ele>726.0</ele>
    <name>Clough Head 726m</name>
    <desc>A 726m fell at the north end of the Dodds with a steep western face. Detour: +2.4km, +372m ascent.</desc>
    <type>peaks</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.578964" lon="-3.255136">
    <name>Night 4 — camp</name>
    <type>camp</type>
  </wpt>
